# Report registry

## Pattern

- Menu entries: `reports/reportMenuDefs.ts` (`forTypes`, labels, ids).
- HTTP: `src/api/side-action-reports.ts`.
- Document builders: `reports/build*ReportDocument.ts`.
- Prefer a registry map `reportRegistry[type][reportId] = { fetch, buildDocument }` as the system grows.

## Forbidden

- Adding substantial fetch/config/build logic into `SideActionReportsMenuModal`.
- Copy-pasting a new report type only inside the modal without menu defs + API module + builder.

## Thin shell

The menu modal selects a report and opens preview/print. It should not become the report system.

## Print chrome

Shared logo, `@page`, fonts, tables: `print-report-kit.mdc` + `src/utils/sideActionReportPrint.ts`.
Builders stay thin — no one-off document shells.

